@406 = ~Temporal Field:~
@407 = ~Temporal Field:
The Chronomancer bends the flow of time within a localized area, creating a warped field where seconds stretch and compress unevenly. Within this distorted pocket of reality, allies move with unnatural speed and clarity, while enemies struggle through sluggish, delayed motion as if every action must push through thickened time itself.
Though the effect is brief, it is decisive—turning moments of chaos into orchestrated advantage. Blades strike sooner, spells land faster, and hostile reactions arrive too late to matter. When the field collapses, time resumes its natural flow, often leaving only the aftermath of a battle already decided.
For the next 5 rounds, all allies around the caster are hasted, while all enemies are slowed unless they make a save vs. spell at a -4 penalty.
Using this ability leaves the Chronomancer fatigued for 2 rounds.~